            ), as amended by Directive 89/604/EEC (
               20
            ).

body.p:
3.  The provisions of Directive 69/169/EEC (
            21
         ) as last amended by Directive 91/191/EEC (
            22
         ) relating to value added tax shall cease to have effect on 31 December 1992 as regards relations between Member States.
